these values verbatim.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Products (cards, in this order)\",\n    \"text\": \"Products (cards, in this order)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Syltherine · Stylish cafe chair · Rs. 2,500,000.00 · old Rs. 3,500,000.00 · badge -30% (Photo_Product_Syltherine) Leviosa · Stylish cafe chair · Rs. 2,500,000.00 (Photo_Product_Leviosa) Lolito · Luxury big sofa · Rs. 7,000,000.00 · old Rs. 14,000,000.00 · badge -50% (Photo_Product_Lolito) Respira · Outdoor bar table and stool · Rs. 500,000.00 · badge New (Photo_Product_Respira) Grifo · Night lamp · Rs. 1,500,000.00 (Photo_Product_Grifo) Muggo · Small mug · Rs. 150,000.00 · badge New (Photo_Product_Muggo) Pingky · Cute bed set · Rs. 7,000,000.00 · old Rs. 14,000,000.00 · badge -50% (Photo_Product_Pingky) Potty · Minimalist flower pot · Rs. 500,000.00 · badge New (Photo_Product_Potty)\",\n    \"text\": \"Syltherine · Stylish cafe chair · Rs. 2,500,000.00 · old Rs. 3,500,000.00 · badge -30% (Photo_Product_Syltherine)\\nLeviosa · Stylish cafe chair · Rs. 2,500,000.00 (Photo_Product_Leviosa)\\nLolito · Luxury big sofa · Rs. 7,000,000.00 · old Rs. 14,000,000.00 · badge -50% (Photo_Product_Lolito)\\nRespira · Outdoor bar table and stool · Rs. 500,000.00 · badge New (Photo_Product_Respira)\\nGrifo · Night lamp · Rs. 1,500,000.00 (Photo_Product_Grifo)\\nMuggo · Small mug · Rs. 150,000.00 · badge New (Photo_Product_Muggo)\\nPingky · Cute bed set · Rs. 7,000,000.00 · old Rs. 14,000,000.00 · badge -50% (Photo_Product_Pingky)\\nPotty · Minimalist flower pot · Rs. 500,000.00 · badge New (Photo_Product_Potty)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Asgaard sofa (03)\",\n    \"text\": \"Asgaard sofa (03)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Rs. 250,000.00 · rating 4.7 · 204 Customer Reviews · Reviews [204] Size: L · XL · XS (selected L) Color: purple #816DFA · black #000000 · gold #B88E2F SKU SS001 · Category Sofas · Tags Sofa, Chair, Home, Shop\",\n    \"text\": \"Rs. 250,000.00 · rating 4.7 · 204 Customer Reviews · Reviews [204]\\nSize: L · XL · XS (selected L)\\nColor: purple #816DFA · black #000000 · gold #B88E2F\\nSKU SS001 · Category Sofas · Tags Sofa, Chair, Home, Shop\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Asgaard copy (03)\",\n    \"text\": \"Asgaard copy (03)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Short: Setting the bar as one of the most comfortable sofas in its class, the Asgaard is a compact, sturdy three-seater with a solid-wood frame and deep, soft cushions. Description ¶1: Embodying the relaxed, honest spirit of Scandinavian design, the Asgaard pairs a solid-wood frame with soft, hard-wearing upholstery, built to be lived on every day. Description ¶2: Weighing in at 45 kg, the Asgaard is sturdy without being bulky. Its high-density foam cushions keep their shape, the removable covers are easy to care for, and the low, clean silhouette fits a small apartment as comfortably as a large living room.\",\n    \"text\": \"Short: Setting the bar as one of the most comfortable sofas in its class, the Asgaard is a compact, sturdy three-seater with a solid-wood frame and deep, soft cushions.\\nDescription ¶1: Embodying the relaxed, honest spirit of Scandinavian design, the Asgaard pairs a solid-wood frame with soft, hard-wearing upholstery, built to be lived on every day.\\nDescription ¶2: Weighing in at 45 kg, the Asgaard is sturdy without being bulky. Its high-density foam cushions keep their shape, the removable covers are easy to care for, and the low, clean silhouette fits a small apartment as comfortably as a large living room.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cart (04, 06, 07)\",\n    \"text\": \"Cart (04, 06, 07)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Asgaard sofa · 1 × Rs. 250,000.00 (Photo_Asgaard_Sofa) Subtotal Rs. 250,000.00 · Total Rs. 250,000.00\",\n    \"text\": \"Asgaard sofa · 1 × Rs. 250,000.00 (Photo_Asgaard_Sofa)\\nSubtotal Rs. 250,000.00 · Total Rs. 250,000.00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Comparison (05) · products\",\n    \"text\": \"Comparison (05) · products\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Asgaard Sofa · Rs. 250,000.00 · 4.7 · 204 Review (Photo_Asgaard_Sofa) Outdoor Sofa Set · Rs. 224,000.00 · 4.2 · 145 Review (Photo_Outdoor_Sofa_Set)\",\n    \"text\": \"Asgaard Sofa · Rs. 250,000.00 · 4.7 · 204 Review (Photo_Asgaard_Sofa)\\nOutdoor Sofa Set · Rs. 224,000.00 · 4.2 · 145 Review (Photo_Outdoor_Sofa_Set)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Comparison (05) · General / Product\",\n    \"text\": \"Comparison (05) · General / Product\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Values: Asgaard Sofa | Outdoor Sofa Set General Sales Package: 1 sectional sofa | 1 Three Seater, 2 Single Seater Model Number: TFCBLIGRBL6SRHS | DTUBLIGRBL568 Secondary Material: Solid Wood | Solid Wood Configuration: L-shaped | L-shaped Upholstery Material: Fabric + Cotton | Fabric + Cotton Upholstery Color: Bright Grey & Lion | Bright Grey & Lion Product Filling Material: Foam | Foam Finish Type: Matte | Matte Adjustable Headrest: No | Yes Maximum Load Capacity: 280 KG | 300 KG Origin of Manufacture: India | India\",\n    \"text\": \"Values: Asgaard Sofa | Outdoor Sofa Set\\nGeneral\\nSales Package: 1 sectional sofa | 1 Three Seater, 2 Single Seater\\nModel Number: TFCBLIGRBL6SRHS | DTUBLIGRBL568\\nSecondary Material: Solid Wood | Solid Wood\\nConfiguration: L-shaped | L-shaped\\nUpholstery Material: Fabric + Cotton | Fabric + Cotton\\nUpholstery Color: Bright Grey & Lion | Bright Grey & Lion\\nProduct\\nFilling Material: Foam | Foam\\nFinish Type: Matte | Matte\\nAdjustable Headrest: No | Yes\\nMaximum Load Capacity: 280 KG | 300 KG\\nOrigin of Manufacture: India | India\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Comparison (05) · Dimensions / Warranty\",\n    \"text\": \"Comparison (05) · Dimensions / Warranty\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Dimensions Width: 265.32 cm | 265.32 cm Height: 76 cm | 76 cm Depth: 167.76 cm | 167.76 cm Weight: 45 KG | 65 KG Seat Height: 41.52 cm | 41.52 cm Leg Height: 5.46 cm | 5.46 cm Warranty Warranty Summary: 1 Year Manufacturing Warranty | 1.2 Year Manufacturing Warranty Warranty Service Type: For Warranty Claims or Any Product Related Issues Please Email at operations@furniro.example | … at support@furniro.example Covered in Warranty: Warranty Against Manufacturing Defect | Warranty of the product is limited to manufacturing defects only. Not Covered in Warranty (both): The Warranty Does Not Cover Damages Due To Usage Of The Product Beyond Its Intended Use And Wear & Tear In The Natural Course Of Product Usage. Domestic Warranty: 1 Year | 3 Months\",\n    \"text\": \"Dimensions\\nWidth: 265.32 cm | 265.32 cm\\nHeight: 76 cm | 76 cm\\nDepth: 167.76 cm | 167.76 cm\\nWeight: 45 KG | 65 KG\\nSeat Height: 41.52 cm | 41.52 cm\\nLeg Height: 5.46 cm | 5.46 cm\\nWarranty\\nWarranty Summary: 1 Year Manufacturing Warranty | 1.2 Year Manufacturing Warranty\\nWarranty Service Type: For Warranty Claims or Any Product Related Issues Please Email at operations@furniro.example | … at support@furniro.example\\nCovered in Warranty: Warranty Against Manufacturing Defect | Warranty of the product is limited to manufacturing defects only.\\nNot Covered in Warranty (both): The Warranty Does Not Cover Damages Due To Usage Of The Product Beyond Its Intended Use And Wear & Tear In The Natural Course Of Product Usage.\\nDomestic Warranty: 1 Year | 3 Months\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Checkout (07)\",\n    \"text\": \"Checkout (07)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Country / Region: Sri Lanka · Province: Western Province Direct Bank Transfer note: Make your payment directly into our bank account. Please use your Order ID as the payment reference. Your order will not be shipped until the funds have cleared in our account. Privacy note: Your personal data will be used to support your experience throughout this website, to manage access to your account, and for other purposes described in our privacy policy.\",\n    \"text\": \"Country / Region: Sri Lanka · Province: Western Province\\nDirect Bank Transfer note: Make your payment directly into our bank account. Please use your Order ID as the payment reference. Your order will not be shipped until the funds have cleared in our account.\\nPrivacy note: Your personal data will be used to support your experience throughout this website, to manage access to your account, and for other purposes described in our privacy policy.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Contact (08)\",\n    \"text\": \"Contact (08)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Intro: For more information about our products & services, please feel free to drop us an email. Our staff will always be there to help you out. Do not hesitate! Address: 236 5th SE Avenue, New York NY10000, United States Phone: Mobile: +(84) 546-6789 · Hotline: +(84) 456-6789 Working Time: Monday–Friday: 9:00 – 22:00 · Saturday–Sunday: 9:00 – 21:00\",\n    \"text\": \"Intro: For more information about our products & services, please feel free to drop us an email. Our staff will always be there to help you out. Do not hesitate!\\nAddress: 236 5th SE Avenue, New York NY10000, United States\\nPhone: Mobile: +(84) 546-6789 · Hotline: +(84) 456-6789\\nWorking Time: Monday–Friday: 9:00 – 22:00 · Saturday–Sunday: 9:00 – 21:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Blog posts (09, in this order)\",\n    \"text\": \"Blog posts (09, in this order)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"All by Admin · 14 Oct 2022 1. Going all-in with millennial design · Wood (Photo_Blog_1) — Soft pastels, rounded silhouettes and natural wood: how millennial design took over the living room, and how to make it feel personal rather than borrowed from a feed. 2. Exploring new ways of decorating · Handmade (Photo_Blog_2) — Moving one lamp can change a whole room. Simple ways to refresh your space with what you already own, plus a few handmade pieces that add character. 3. Handmade pieces that took time to make · Wood (Photo_Blog_3) — From hand-turned legs to woven seats: meet the makers behind some of our favourite pieces and learn why slow craftsmanship lasts longer.\",\n    \"text\": \"All by Admin · 14 Oct 2022\\n1. Going all-in with millennial design · Wood (Photo_Blog_1) — Soft pastels, rounded silhouettes and natural wood: how millennial design took over the living room, and how to make it feel personal rather than borrowed from a feed.\\n2. Exploring new ways of decorating · Handmade (Photo_Blog_2) — Moving one lamp can change a whole room. Simple ways to refresh your space with what you already own, plus a few handmade pieces that add character.\\n3. Handmade pieces that took time to make · Wood (Photo_Blog_3) — From hand-turned legs to woven seats: meet the makers behind some of our favourite pieces and learn why slow craftsmanship lasts longer.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Blog sidebar (09)\",\n    \"text\": \"Blog sidebar (09)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Categories: Crafts 2 · Design 8 · Handmade 7 · Interior 1 · Wood 6 Recent Posts (all 03 Aug 2022): Going all-in with millennial design (Photo_Recent_1) · Exploring new ways of decorating (Photo_Recent_2) · Handmade pieces that took time to make (Photo_Recent_3) · Modern home in Milan (Photo_Recent_4) · Colorful office redesign (Photo_Recent_5)\",\n    \"text\": \"Categories: Crafts 2 · Design 8 · Handmade 7 · Interior 1 · Wood 6\\nRecent Posts (all 03 Aug 2022): Going all-in with millennial design (Photo_Recent_1) · Exploring new ways of decorating (Photo_Recent_2) · Handmade pieces that took time to make (Photo_Recent_3) · Modern home in Milan (Photo_Recent_4) · Colorful office redesign (Photo_Recent_5)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Features strip\",\n    \"text\": \"Features strip\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"High Quality · crafted from top materials (Icon_Trophy) Warranty Protection · Over 2 years (Icon_Guarantee) Free Shipping · Order over Rs. 150,000 (Icon_Shipping) 24 / 7 Support · Dedicated support (Icon_Support)\",\n    \"text\": \"High Quality · crafted from top materials (Icon_Trophy)\\nWarranty Protection · Over 2 years (Icon_Guarantee)\\nFree Shipping · Order over Rs. 150,000 (Icon_Shipping)\\n24 / 7 Support · Dedicated support (Icon_Support)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Footer (all frames)\",\n    \"text\": \"Footer (all frames)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"“Furniro.” · 400 University Drive Suite 200, Coral Gables, FL 33134 USA Links: Home · Shop · About · Contact Help: Payment Options · Returns · Privacy Policies Newsletter: “Enter Your Email Address” · “SUBSCRIBE” “2023 Furniro. All rights reserved”\",\n    \"text\": \"“Furniro.” · 400 University Drive Suite 200, Coral Gables, FL 33134 USA\\nLinks: Home · Shop · About · Contact\\nHelp: Payment Options · Returns · Privacy Policies\\nNewsletter: “Enter Your Email Address” · “SUBSCRIBE”\\n“2023 Furniro. All rights reserved”\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"What is fixed · what is yours\",\n    \"text\": \"What is fixed · what is yours\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Fixed (given)\",\n    \"text\": \"Fixed (given)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand color #B88E2F and Poppins • Media: logo, photos, social logos, icons • Default Button, default Text Field\",\n    \"text\": \"• Frame list and exact names\\n• Must-include content per frame (what, not how)\\n• Navigation structure and links\\n• All data and copy\\n• Brand color #B88E2F and Poppins\\n• Media: logo, photos, social logos, icons\\n• Default Button, default Text Field\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Yours (designer decides)\",\n    \"text\": \"Yours (designer decides)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"• Layout, grid, grouping, order and emphasis on every page • All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / section tints, badges (sale, new), rating, links, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current nav item, card hover, selected size, current tab, current page, selected payment, current slide, focused field • Header, footer, page title & breadcrumb, product card, toolbar, pagination, gallery, option pickers, stepper, tabs, comparison table, cart table, drawer, order summary, forms, blog card, sidebar widgets, feature strip • How photos are cropped and placed\",\n    \"text\": \"• Layout, grid, grouping, order and emphasis on every page\\n• All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / section tints, badges (sale, new), rating, links, error / disabled\\n• Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation\\n• All states: current nav item, card hover, selected size, current tab, current page, selected payment, current slide, focused field\\n• Header, footer, page title & breadcrumb, product card, toolbar, pagination, gallery, option pickers, stepper, tabs, comparison table, cart table, drawer, order summary, forms, blog card, sidebar widgets, feature strip\\n• How photos are cropped and placed\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"How it is evaluated\",\n    \"text\": \"How it is evaluated\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\",\n    \"text\": \"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data & copy accuracy 3. Flow & prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current nav, card hover, selected options, current tab and page)\",\n    \"text\": \"1. Checklist coverage per frame\\n2. Data & copy accuracy\\n3. Flow & prototype completeness\\n4. Information hierarchy\\n5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system\\n6. Component reuse\\n7. State design (current nav, card hover, selected options, current tab and page)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 9 named frames, your components and the prototype.\",\n    \"text\": \"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 9 named frames, your component