{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202611011924183877244308268d9d6kcF0fUBZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Reasoning summary: Completed design and prototype tasks. Summary of deliverables provided.\n\nFinal answer:\n### 设计完成报告\n\n所有家具电商网站（Furniro）的设计与原型连线任务已全部在 assigned Figma 文件的 **03 · Workspace** 页面中完成。\n\n---\n\n#### 1. 交付文件与 Workspace 信息\n- **Figma 文件 URL**: [https://www.figma.com/design/lyAJXJy8GatyIPzWRh2m00/](https://www.figma.com/design/lyAJXJy8GatyIPzWRh2m00/)\n- **03 · Workspace Page ID**: `15:2`\n\n---\n\n#### 2. 交付的 9 个标准 Frame 列表与 ID\n\n1. **`01_Home`** (Node ID: `18:2`):\n   - Header (Logo + 导航 + 图标)\n   - Hero Section (\"New Arrival\", \"Discover Our New Collection\", \"BUY NOW\")\n   - Browse The Range (Dining, Living, Bedroom)\n   - Our Products (8款产品卡片，Leviosa 卡片处于 Hover 悬停态，包含 Add to cart / Share / Compare / Like)\n   - Inspiration (\"50+ Beautiful rooms inspiration\", \"01 — Bed Room\", \"Inner Peace\", 轮播指示器)\n   - Share your setup (#FurniroFurniture 9图宫格)\n   - Footer\n\n2. **`02_Shop`** (Node ID: `20:11`):\n   - Page Banner & Breadcrumb (Home › Shop)\n   - Toolbar (Filter, Grid/List 切换, 结果数, Show 16, Sort by)\n   - Products (16款产品卡片，Leviosa 悬停态)\n   - Pagination (1 · 2 · 3 · Next)\n   - Features Strip (High Quality, Warranty Protection, Free Shipping, 24 / 7 Support)\n   - Footer\n\n3. **`03_Product`** (Node ID: `21:27`):\n   - Breadcrumb (Home › Shop › Asgaard sofa)\n   - Gallery (主图 + 4张缩略图)\n   - Product Details (标题、价格 Rs. 250,000.00、4.7星级 204条评价、短描述)\n   - Options (Size L/XL/XS选L，Color紫/黑/金)\n   - Purchase (数量步进器 `- 1 +`、\"Add To Cart\"按钮、\"+ Compare\"按钮)\n   - Meta (SKU SS001, Category Sofas, Tags, 社媒分享)\n   - Tabs (Description 2段文字、Photo_Cloud_Sofa_1 & 2，Additional Info, Reviews [204])\n   - Related Products (4款相关产品 + Show More)\n\n4. **`04_Cart_Drawer`** (Node ID: `21:212`):\n   - 背景为浅色蒙版覆盖的 03_Product 页面\n   - 抽屉侧滑栏 (\"Shopping Cart\", 关闭按钮, Asgaard sofa `1 x Rs. 250,000.00`, 移除图标, Subtotal Rs. 250,000.00)\n   - 底部操作按钮 (\"Cart\", \"Checkout\", \"Comparison\")\n\n5. **`05_Comparison`** (Node ID: `22:58`):\n   - Banner & Breadcrumb (Home › Comparison)\n   - 比对栏 (\"Go to Product page for more Products\" + \"View More\"、Asgaard Sofa 卡片与评分、Outdoor Sofa Set 卡片与评分、\"Add A Product\" 下拉菜单)\n   - 详细规格对比表 (分组：General, Product, Dimensions, Warranty，逐行双值对比)\n   - 底部各产品 \"Add To Cart\" 按钮\n   - Features Strip & Footer\n\n6. **`06_Cart`** (Node ID: `23:78`):\n   - Banner & Breadcrumb (Home › Cart)\n   - Cart Table (列：Product, Price, Quantity, Subtotal；Asgaard sofa 行与 Icon_Delete)\n   - Cart Totals (Subtotal Rs. 250,000.00, Total Rs. 250,000.00, \"Check Out\" 按钮)\n   - Features Strip & Footer\n\n7. **`07_Checkout`** (Node ID: `24:88`):\n   - Banner & Breadcrumb (Home › Checkout)\n   - Billing details 表单 (First/Last Name, Company, Country: Sri Lanka, Street, City, Province: Western Province, ZIP, Phone, Email, Additional info)\n   - Order summary (Asgaard sofa x 1, Subtotal Rs. 250,000.00, Total Rs. 250,000.00)\n   - Payment options (Direct Bank Transfer 选中及说明，Cash On Delivery，隐私政策文本)\n   - \"Place order\" 按钮\n   - Features Strip & Footer\n\n8. **`08_Contact`** (Node ID: `25:99`):\n   - Banner & Breadcrumb (Home › Contact)\n   - Intro (\"Get In Touch With Us\")\n   - Contact details (Address, Phone, Working Time 及图标)\n   - Form (Your name, Email address, Subject, Message, \"Submit\" 按钮)\n   - Features Strip & Footer\n\n9. **`09_Blog`** (Node ID: `26:111`):\n   - Banner & Breadcrumb (Home › Blog)\n   - Posts 列表 (3篇文章，包含封面图、Admin/Date/Tag 元信息、标题、摘要及 \"Read more\")\n   - Sidebar (搜索框、Categories 统计、Recent Posts 5篇带缩略图)\n   - Pagination (1 · 2 · 3 · Next)\n   - Features Strip & Footer\n\n---\n\n#### 3. 完成的原型交互连线 (Prototype Connections)\n- `01_Home` ➔ `02_Shop` (通过 Header Nav \"Shop\" / Hero \"BUY NOW\" / \"Show More\")\n- `01_Home` ➔ `03_Product` (点击任何产品卡片)\n- `01_Home` ➔ `05_Comparison` (点击 Leviosa 悬停卡片上的 Compare)\n- `01_Home` ➔ `06_Cart` (点击 Header 购物车图标)\n- `01_Home` ➔ `08_Contact` (点击 Header Nav \"Contact\")\n- `01_Home` ➔ `09_Blog` (点击 Footer 链接 \"Blog\")\n- `02_Shop` ➔ `03_Product` (点击产品卡片) / `05_Comparison` (Leviosa Compare) / `01_Home` / `06_Cart`\n- `03_Product` ➔ `04_Cart_Drawer` (点击 \"Add To Cart\")\n- `03_Product` ➔ `05_Comparison` (点击 \"+ Compare\")\n- `04_Cart_Drawer` ➔ `06_Cart` (\"Cart\") / `07_Checkout` (\"Checkout\") / `05_Comparison` (\"Comparison\") / `03_Product` (关闭按钮)\n- `05_Comparison` ➔ `02_Shop` (\"View More\") / `06_Cart` (\"Add To Cart\")\n- `06_Cart` ➔ `07_Checkout` (\"Check Out\") / `03_Product` (点击商品名)\n- `08_Contact` & `09_Blog` ➔ `01_Home` (导航链接)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":144856,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":139034},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68369d55-e3dd-4325-b303-55296225c818","uuid":"96601184-e97c-46fb-aa99-e8f4fb4e9934","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:24:39.257Z"}
